/* 2026-07-07 follow-up 8: user's phone screenshot showed Country/State
   dropdowns in Calculate Shipping cut off past the right edge — a
   SEPARATE nested table (#v65-cart-shipping-details, fixed by JS
   alongside the cart-items table, see mc-plp-enforcer.js) from the cart
