/* 2026-07-09 CART SHIPPING "TYPE OF ADDRESS" RADIO OVERFLOW + COLLAPSED
   FIELDS — user's phone screenshot showed Residential/Business text cut
   off past the right edge below the Country/State/Zip fields fixed
   above. First root cause found: the `input` selector in the rule above
   also matches the two <input type="radio"> in the Type Of Address row,
   stretching each ~13px radio to 100% of its column, leaving no room for
   the adjacent label text, which then overflows past the cell/viewport
